    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Starter at [-57.44, -33.66, -1182.39]: BJX fork Battles.lua:66 (Npcs.json Id 46241, cray_boss_swamp.adr). (R) the fork's own placement, not a captured one. Region None, place None."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 69 ('Mudshell (the live random encounter: Mudshell, an elder cray, outside Cray Caves)'): scene ss_random_encounter_01, entry, exit, 4 waves, 17 spawns ({'Cray Snapper': 6, 'Cray': 6, 'Cray Marauder': 4, 'Mudshell': 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1248 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene ss_random_encounter_01 has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 75 coins / 260 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "rc-0137 prize wheel: fandom 'Mudshell' (revision 30403) lists one prize wheel per combat job and a 10-coin slot; any other job spins the items every job's wheel holds. Brawler: the wiki's 'Bare-Knuckle Brawler Shoulder Pads' is 'Bare-Knuckle Brawler Shoulderpads' in our record dungeons/mudshell.json; Brawler: the wiki's 'Brawer's Atlas Hammer of Rage' is 'Brawler's Atlas Hammer of Rage' in our record dungeons/mudshell.json."
